      <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new on the Mac</h3>
<p><b>The microphone starts after you switch.</b> After using a different microphone, such as EarPods or AirPods, dictation could fail with "Can't start the microphone" until you quit and reopened Murmur. It now starts with whichever microphone you're using, and if one changes just as it starts, it tries again on its own.</p>]]></description>
